@page One CSS path
@input [type=email, aria-label=Email, focus:outline 2 solid var(--brand)]
@el [outline 2 red, container card / inline-size, contain content]
  An outline without a style draws none
@el [width calc(100% - 2 * 8px), content-visibility auto, line-clamp 2]
  Values are CSS's
@h2 Defaults stay on htmlang's elements
@ul
  @li No marker
@link /home Home
@markdown
  - keeps its bullet and [its underline](/x)
@dialog A closed dialog stays hidden
@el [hidden] So does a hidden element
